# [[.Name]]

Object storage bucket. Generated by kickhub from `[[.Template]]` v[[.Version]], target **[[.Target]]**.
[[ if eq .Target "local" ]]
```sh
make up     # MinIO on :9000 (S3 API) and :9001 (console), bucket "[[.Name]]" created
make down
```

Any S3 SDK works against it: endpoint `http://localhost:9000`, access key `local`, secret `localsecret`, path-style addressing.
[[ else ]]
```sh
make infra-plan
make infra-apply
terraform -chdir=infra output bucket
```

The bucket is private, versioned and encrypted. Move Terraform state to a remote backend before sharing this repo.
[[ end ]]